+## Errors that must not return
+- #91/#113 false-green bypass class (credential-skip / fallback-green / `|| true`) on the merge-chain gate.
+- ANY merge without an exact-SHA Fleet PRE `READY_FOR_OCEAN` certificate.
+- Certificate freshness drift (stale >24h accepted), head SHA mismatch, or verdict relaxation.
